    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nikita is no longer a student, but he still hasn\u2019t found his place in life. He\u2019s spiraling downward: using illegal substances, working a job he hates, slowly fading away. He begins to see a girl everywhere \u2014 a girl who once loved him. He sees her in dreams, in passing strangers... Each encounter reminds him of his vices, the mistakes he\u2019s made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will he be able to learn the lessons from these dances of a troubled subconscious \u2014 lessons that could help change his life for the better \u2014 or will he become forever lost in the world he\u2019s created in his own mind...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An atmospheric drama with psychological thriller elements</strong><br>Dive into the world of the main character, where the boundaries between dreams and reality blur. Help Nikita make choices that determine his future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear story and decision-based outcomes</strong><br>Every action and choice leads to new scenarios and endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A visual novel with point-and-click elements</strong><br>Pay attention! Every detail might matter, and only by exploring the protagonist\u2019s inner world can you find a way out of the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark visual style</strong><br>Post-Soviet landscapes: courtyards, train stations, panel housing. The aesthetics are an important part of the story.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nikita is no longer a student, but he still hasn\u2019t found his place in life. He\u2019s spiraling downward: using illegal substances, working a job he hates, slowly fading away. He begins to see a girl everywhere \u2014 a girl who once loved him. He sees her in dreams, in passing strangers... Each encounter reminds him of his vices, the mistakes he\u2019s made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will he be able to learn the lessons from these dances of a troubled subconscious \u2014 lessons that could help change his life for the better \u2014 or will he become forever lost in the world he\u2019s created in his own mind...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An atmospheric drama with psychological thriller elements</strong><br>Dive into the world of the main character, where the boundaries between dreams and reality blur. Help Nikita make choices that determine his future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear story and decision-based outcomes</strong><br>Every action and choice leads to new scenarios and endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A visual novel with point-and-click elements</strong><br>Pay attention! Every detail might matter, and only by exploring the protagonist\u2019s inner world can you find a way out of the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark visual style</strong><br>Post-Soviet landscapes: courtyards, train stations, panel housing. The aesthetics are an important part of the story.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Reality imprints itself on our individuality through pain. Like grooves on a vinyl record, scars on the soul shape sounds out of emptiness.",
